{"job_id":"F-46daca1e29f8eabd95aa","family_id":"F-46daca1e29f8eabd95aa","title":"한국해양소년단연맹 육성에 관한 법률","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":19,"target_id":"e58e5bc685084e34808e3fc4467f25ba1e9a74625f08a08421dae77531cf011e","source_hash":"e8f7fee629afc94fc0a9b0e476e468fd92bc8fae0166b074261841ede5263f6a","text":"韩国海洋青年联合会促进法"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":135,"target_id":"d6cfe61d094595c1ca193766e6b83d50d062508aa1a7a5bf3b9ff0be16cf071b","source_hash":"6a1022b6ae8b5b61c4772f8fa6dd419d1f6ec2a1f7172d56f2cc3255b6c3c17b","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是通过支持和扶持韩国海洋青年联合会，为海洋发展和国家进步做出贡献。该联合会的成立宗旨是通过对青少年进行海洋方面的教育和培训，灌输海洋思维，培养强烈的民族认同感和进取精神。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":135,"end":223,"target_id":"fe4f6ea62f78cec86f8bdb737cbaa476cd9e521bdded8b145a711c5344461272","source_hash":"79a9481deab76c4a402d1c42b0d415bccae0cf152ece93e058e4d7fab7d57524","text":"第二条（合作与支持）国家或地方政府可以为韩国海洋青年联合会（以下简称“联合会”）的组织和活动提供必要的便利，并提供合作与支持。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":223,"end":508,"target_id":"5d60ebe07ac3799fa49a4b6fab156bcb311fed6422c6ed90c204cef16509b4cf","source_hash":"5d2b556d1a4c3da7a3e06dd230ff3261bcf88d63d2d13e780cd985abba25b414","text":"第三条（国有和公共财产租赁及设施支持等）\n① 尽管《国家财产法》或《公共财产和物资管理法》等有相关规定，但为促进联邦的需要，国家或地方政府可以无偿出租或转让国有财产、公共财产、学校设施和军事设施，或者允许他人使用和享用，只要这种使用不受到阻碍。\n② 根据第1款规定，租赁、转让或免费使用财产或设施并从中获利的情况，其细节和条件由相关财产或设施的管理机构与联合会之间的合同确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":508,"end":654,"target_id":"10cb15426089ea2dba8ec7eefd928299ad8b3ad4743d9bc054677bbc0754aa54","source_hash":"40e0fa4e0f86eaf1dcad46139f50a6ab5a4fe2341a22f92516b86f9c7ffd577f","text":"第4条（子公司等）\n① 国家或地方政府可以补贴联合会的运营费用、设施费用以及组织和活动所需的费用，以及国内和海外活动的费用。\n② 个人、公司或组织可以捐赠资金或其他财产，以支持联合会的设施和运营。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":654,"end":788,"target_id":"116e4001228dd6e1f8bd80107229fa35f8bd67b752cb137271732e85d10498eb","source_hash":"bb791983b69709d8e7265ac5c15363de2cff5f658cbf06c269729b8bb350255d","text":"第五条（免税等）\n① 根据《特别税限制法》，政府可给予联邦税收减免或豁免。\n② 对于根据第 4 条第 2 款捐赠给联邦的金钱或其他财产，可以适用《特别税收限制法》规定的收入计算特别规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":788,"end":870,"target_id":"96f3e9089d594d5a07189f04d7c15b42333b076eaf54de6eb6bdd57f6422ae37","source_hash":"184cbbf994bdf94b56c7aca81c597873508128063d447fd9063085830beea681","text":"第六条（支持组织的业务）支持联合会的个人或组织（以下简称“联合会支持组织”）经海洋水产部长批准，可以进行必要的营利性业务。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":870,"end":1088,"target_id":"cfd0891fff2c715aec698fa50f0011eb766438c8a921ee9b8120869cf9c033a1","source_hash":"714949ba532e40cc0766e23cc3dccb630a2859d04d3f15c07090ec63d054f942","text":"第七条（暂停营利性业务的命令）\n① 海洋水产大臣发现根据第六条开展营利性业务的联合会支援组织正在或可能将该业务产生的利润用于联合会管理以外的目的时，大臣可以命令该联合会支援组织暂停该业务不超过六个月，并采取必要措施。\n② 根据第1款规定暂停营业的详细标准及其他必要事项，由海洋水产部条例规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1088,"end":1182,"target_id":"c2e6f468e0fbc83d0989419c1c6f200ae40a16427d81896588d34298c0bafb68","source_hash":"4b07bc665f870e554cdb52a8a6a6ad6cf6518c7ac470ea08d185347912cb1fdd","text":"第八条（提交预算报告等） 联合会应编制下一年度的预算报告和业务计划，并在每个财政年度开始前提交给海洋和渔业部长。修改预算报告和业务计划时，也应遵循同样的程序。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1182,"end":1277,"target_id":"96a76b3a700fe309e2e2925f784ea3aef982f4e37716ab99c1b41f277d05521a","source_hash":"fbac87180b83b1116a17a081aa7a73e7d35a5f2dd55b7548dd4c89107ce08b43","text":"第九条（提交结算报告等）联合会应于次年3月31日前，向海洋和渔业部长提交每个财政年度的收入和支出结算报告，并附上该年度的经营业绩结果。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1277,"end":1379,"target_id":"eeeb96050893146049c911933676824a7290607a5ee783feb45d01e2c383f9ff","source_hash":"f47a3c1e13e945bb9aa37fe68470a621fe2a06ef4865075cf430726794081474","text":"第十条（作业检查等）海洋和渔业部长认为必要时，可以要求该联邦提交有关其作业的数据或报告，或者让其管辖范围内的官员检查此类作业。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1379,"end":1444,"target_id":"6471da7693af716f20cad681f5c6b913cda18a641652dbc2d16efaa89c3fa412","source_hash":"da98263fe5fe9c6a8ca110476f2215a04dc6457e5c553f953aa74dcb550445e6","text":"第 11 条（禁止使用类似名称）除本联合会外，任何人不得使用“韩国海洋青年联合会”的名称或与其类似的名称。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1444,"end":1506,"target_id":"9750868a68a6d21b4dd3e99404ee26094e8bec3c6127295444b0ee86b36880b1","source_hash":"f5dd3ffb91d3f67a5a75f735cd87a24968a6cd5d9b3da6b50941e36133f847f3","text":"第十二条（行政罚款） 违反第十一条规定的，处以不超过三百万韩元的行政罚款。（2020年2月18日修订）\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1506,"end":1528,"target_id":"e64749b2aac4b450b7cbf203b255a7568f0b110d8e14be36669ce2c369d1d61f","source_hash":"bb9a6d5ce19ce4fa1425a626cf31a9351594410d7d13f21d4fbd1e283decc39f","text":"第13条已删除 <1997.12.17>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1528,"end":1639,"target_id":"bf4e60e4f8c0d5efa113906818d236b7059bd96c4d32695b97e6c57efc520d10","source_hash":"35509a2f5b9e98ae872d3b0f8a5ad16314cffc22adf5723971b500c065ca9438","text":"补充规定 <第3785号，1984年12月31日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n②（过渡措施）在本法实施时已存在的韩国海洋青年联合会，应视为本法下的韩国海洋青年联合会。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1639,"end":1670,"target_id":"2f75db37730603d5dad5af5666148d05d6149651df2b705091d38ed8b9341bdd","source_hash":"003db7c6cb4052faec38095433d19e94c4db356ad657a0816e6e52cd5a667654","text":"补充条款（政府组织法）<1990年12月27日第4268号法令>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1670,"end":1708,"target_id":"3b2cb248d928d0eceab05a81e8a382f02f49d9a690dfa617673c8f19813e05a7","source_hash":"57592edde8f8d3b6e2ef6b7b41aa8a7bc16fba6b86566ba43ff28446d3e8b22e","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1708,"end":1723,"target_id":"999a93f50cbb66c1caf8055f66feae721f071d39c29c32351215d7768d9d1a1f","source_hash":"83d7e2617f4bf3ca8b29241abcde12e5b43dc5f987d1316993039fbd766a366d","text":"省略第 2 至 7 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1723,"end":1796,"target_id":"23e5e07d7a1cb73a05dacc2bc78e839ff94cab586910ec69a53cb3667561c46e","source_hash":"1785d5a335b82bfd65185551927ff284fe3be5b4f4740ba7b3efc109fdbb0222","text":"第八条（为协调各部委事务而对其他法律进行修正）①至⑨ 已省略\n\n  ⑩ 《韩国海洋青年联盟促进法》修正如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1796,"end":1842,"target_id":"87084253eec6af0cda4c07da55a1c4a0c5cd5bb2472393fec380e992d289b773","source_hash":"0b8220148505dea5fd3eddd632112f56357cfbde36c0a9593402f84f15afb967","text":"  在第 6 条至第 10 条中，“海事和港口管理局局长”应改为“体育和青年事务部长”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1842,"end":1857,"target_id":"3b026e14f0554985118ae5e90dae1be98fffea93acc7ef44cd968e5844eff850","source_hash":"4cebcba8640f61c525b67cbaab1cbf376d3cc86144e5665cb29d1c360dcfa1a5","text":"条款 9 和 10 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1857,"end":1886,"target_id":"4b85a8e473e3fd9d0965ca28974ae37a201341dfd49b09acfa5a834da1c6d7be","source_hash":"c3e32fc3e7ccbfa7c1fedde3b5992786cf10bfa15e36b0f6f5d7341e45ab815f","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第4541号法令，1993年3月6日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1886,"end":1924,"target_id":"4afd52d4e67b8b539cd0c013ec25607d1e7006d9d01994064185253c1ea91c9b","source_hash":"57592edde8f8d3b6e2ef6b7b41aa8a7bc16fba6b86566ba43ff28446d3e8b22e","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1924,"end":1932,"target_id":"cf411d00593ce08f3a2c09d40cc3317e3bd37b4c1e321fcdde5bb5d04f11ea4d","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1932,"end":2007,"target_id":"29d9e574b15bfc7d56437ec015ea893923ae3231723ff2608ec0f074933694b9","source_hash":"97a3f28619a9433ba7bf0b69705449d04d4224c79c64f69e8f93a7aa7f17b097","text":"第三条（为设立文化体育部而对其他法律的修正）①至⑩ 省略\n\n  ⑪ 《韩国海洋青年联盟促进法》修正如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2007,"end":2068,"target_id":"6456507fbdf942af5167adabd6e18af9978c33c708d0353f6d0a8151697a3640","source_hash":"f24da4dda98ee62e50d0ee375b6861d691edb2d50fa21544bd3b93479174e309","text":"  第 6 条至第 10 条中，“体育和青年部长”应改为“文化和体育部长”。\n\n  ⑫ 至 <35> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2068,"end":2082,"target_id":"bb7f9ad694592f1df025b77d5693be6e8ca85f4561199e668edce3625bfdba4a","source_hash":"505b854c331342cb48efd5424cf798126129d808876646cd1a9e4b5b22346bf6","text":"条款 4 和 5 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2082,"end":2126,"target_id":"eb8269eca3faee59a7cbfbe3e35cac6cf5071951fb8da805c3ee0d3555575770","source_hash":"a02bd6caee9eeeed9569baa36eeb90b399b2b55d05c46411ffb16811ed089374","text":"补充条款 <第5468号，1997年12月17日>\n\n本法自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2126,"end":2156,"target_id":"7f824344a0669163e2b8353ab1ee7a3a17b3b3281234c4deac144211c1209f7b","source_hash":"9f984faffebd91642f1e26e75c1ab3649e306236dd38deee54e7ee1495f626a6","text":"补充条款（政府组织法）<第8852号法令，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2156,"end":2288,"target_id":"c0312e22ff8b75d5ca4cecc8362ae096efd9bc7d735fbe104e007e0a1df863a3","source_hash":"8a2507cda73de4f24375f33bb9ca2d174b5c3ec8338e1c6a148d9d12adc3b275","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，……<省略>……，根据补充条例第六条修正的、在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的法律部分，自各法律的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2288,"end":2305,"target_id":"9825fd3ec29d68658e8ef1c3044c61ae4f83f49d9d5c553c2137ac7a46f4b7d5","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2305,"end":2454,"target_id":"9c3d3802f3cbf1ccd7fa380c11656814cdfdf0f2e70167573bc922944605d3c0","source_hash":"9db9f7701f1c7fee9dd84020ad0bcacb83855f351b391420e4d7122b25ae8cc7","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）① 至<676> 已省略\n\n  <677> 《韩国海洋青年联盟促进法》部分修订如下。\n\n  在第 6 条至第 10 条中，“海洋事务和渔业部长”应改为“陆路、交通和海洋事务部长”。\n\n  <678> 至 <760> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2454,"end":2462,"target_id":"1f6aff1c09a492f0fa9d1600f680f45cb1a03f10d134a68fa327b9114df51025","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00034","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2462,"end":2493,"target_id":"b187823b6829ce2e69fbdb8dd06b527c9d21d8ee164b050eac468156e96baab8","source_hash":"884b1766aaddfed62f208e70764e5d43694b510475476512e06be6a0808c47af","text":"补充条款（政府组织法）<第11690号法令，2013年3月23日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00035","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2493,"end":2533,"target_id":"5d0bb393190fe1b66b4eb6424fd2be23228bfe1b383d87824bbc60fecd27c982","source_hash":"4308f2ced69d66c7c9c6968031f4ce6f1f458352a8aaaa88b04f09add335bc9e","text":"第一条（生效日期）① 本法自公布之日起生效。 \n\n  ② 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00036","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000814-214541-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2533,"end":2550,"target_id":"a8de842c1783a8fac0ccf97459bbb334340612aa1b0355dc95a63d0cce180473","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"}